516
00:27:05,584 --> 00:27:08,704
They named the crisis after the brothers, not the money.

517
00:27:09,484 --> 00:27:11,404
This is how your species assigns blame.).

518
00:27:12,764 --> 00:27:13,424
Here is how it worked,

519
00:27:14,144 --> 00:27:14,644
