522
00:27:24,144 --> 00:27:24,664
Real gold.

523
00:27:25,184 --> 00:27:26,544
The kind you carry out in a box.

524
00:27:27,724 --> 00:27:29,344
This meant that if the U.S.

525
00:27:29,584 --> 00:27:33,484
printed too many dollars, governments would notice (because prices would

526
00:27:33,484 --> 00:27:37,204
drift above thirty-five dollars per ounce on the open market), and they

527
00:27:37,204 --> 00:27:41,404
would start showing up at the window, trading paper for metal, and walking

528
00:27:41,404 --> 00:27:42,364
