529
00:27:43,004 --> 00:27:45,804
The more you printed, the faster your vault emptied.

530
00:27:46,524 --> 00:27:48,284
This was not a rule.

531
00:27:48,544 --> 00:27:52,184
Rules can be rewritten by the same people who wrote them, usually at two

532
00:27:52,184 --> 00:27:52,684
