534
00:27:54,824 --> 00:27:56,844
This was a physical constraint.

535
00:27:57,164 --> 00:27:57,904
Gold is heavy.

536
00:27:58,204 --> 00:27:59,184
It leaves the building.

537
00:27:59,664 --> 00:28:01,404
You can see the shelves getting bare.

538
00:28:02,064 --> 00:28:05,944
The punishment for money-printing was not a sternly worded letter from an

539
00:28:05,944 --> 00:28:06,984
