542
00:28:13,084 --> 00:28:13,584
It worked.

543
00:28:14,244 --> 00:28:14,744
I know.

544
00:28:14,944 --> 00:28:15,904
I was surprised too.

545
00:28:16,644 --> 00:28:20,984
From nineteen forty-eight to nineteen seventy-three, the typical American

546
00:28:21,064 --> 00:28:26,644
