547
00:28:27,524 --> 00:28:28,384
Real G.D.P.

548
00:28:28,604 --> 00:28:32,724
grew four point two percent per year in the nineteen fifties and four point

549
00:28:32,724 --> 00:28:34,864
five percent in the nineteen sixties.

550
00:28:35,484 --> 00:28:40,024
Homeownership surged from forty-four percent to over sixty-two percent in

551
00:28:40,024 --> 00:28:41,184
