552
00:28:42,044 --> 00:28:47,244
A single income could support a family of four, a mortgage, and a retirement.

553
00:28:47,964 --> 00:28:51,324
Income inequality fell to its lowest level of the century.

554
00:28:51,864 --> 00:28:55,304
The Gini coefficient trended down for two straight decades.

555
00:28:56,244 --> 00:28:57,774
This was not a coincidence.

556
00:28:58,444 --> 00:29:02,424
When money is anchored to something politicians can't print, politicians

557
00:29:02,424 --> 00:29:04,304
