569
00:29:38,524 --> 00:29:42,064
per capita grew three point eight percent per year in the eighteen eighties.

570
00:29:42,844 --> 00:29:44,984
Between eighteen eighty and eighteen ninety-six,

571
00:29:45,624 --> 00:29:48,624
