576
00:29:58,244 --> 00:30:00,924
(The evidence on that particular period is detailed below.).

577
00:30:01,724 --> 00:30:03,824
Under Bretton Woods, you did it again.

578
00:30:04,224 --> 00:30:06,084
Twenty-seven years of anchored money.

579
00:30:06,764 --> 00:30:10,164
Twenty-seven years of the median family getting richer.

580
00:30:10,684 --> 00:30:14,924
Then Nixon unanchored it, and median income growth fell from nearly three

581
00:30:14,924 --> 00:30:17,844
percent to zero point six percent per year.

582
00:30:18,184 --> 00:30:19,544
An eighty percent collapse.

583
00:30:20,564 --> 00:30:21,504
Two experiments.

584
00:30:21,884 --> 00:30:23,444
Two gold-anchored systems.

585
00:30:23,884 --> 00:30:28,064
Both produced roughly double the median income growth of the fiat periods

586
00:30:28,064 --> 00:30:28,684
