587
00:30:29,464 --> 00:30:33,104
Then you abandoned them both and the gains stopped reaching the median family.

588
00:30:33,844 --> 00:30:38,024
On Wishonia, when an experiment produces the same result twice, we call

589
00:30:38,024 --> 00:30:38,524
