592
00:30:45,884 --> 00:30:48,244
What Actually Happened.

593
00:30:48,264 --> 00:30:49,784
The gold standard died.

594
00:30:49,884 --> 00:30:53,824
Your species abandoned one shared hallucination (gold, which is a shiny

595
00:30:53,824 --> 00:30:58,304
rock you can't eat) for another shared hallucination (paper, which is a

596
00:30:58,424 --> 00:31:00,444
