605
00:31:24,324 --> 00:31:28,504
Except you can't leave the dollar because your rent is denominated in it.

606
00:31:28,644 --> 00:31:29,514
This is not a coincidence.

607
00:31:30,684 --> 00:31:31,884
The Dual Mandate (Or:

608
00:31:32,724 --> 00:31:34,184
The Two Goals of Serfdom).

