644
00:33:41,484 --> 00:33:41,984
Goal

645
00:33:44,504 --> 00:33:45,004
two:

646
00:33:45,464 --> 00:33:49,344
"Stable Prices" (Take two percent Per Year).

647
00:33:49,344 --> 00:33:52,684
"Stable prices" means two percent inflation per year.

