650
00:34:26,804 --> 00:34:28,444
On Earth,

651
00:34:29,304 --> 00:34:31,464
"stable prices" means prices that rise every year, predictably, forever. This is like calling a sinking ship "stable" because it sinks at a known

652
00:34:31,464 --> 00:34:31,964
