667
00:36:10,904 --> 00:36:13,584
The "Deflation Is Dangerous" Story.

668
00:36:14,444 --> 00:36:19,544
The justification for permanent inflation, taught in every economics class

669
00:36:19,544 --> 00:36:21,623
