686
00:37:31,644 --> 00:37:32,224
In the rain.

687
00:37:32,704 --> 00:37:35,584
Knowing a better one would exist in eleven months.

688
00:37:36,564 --> 00:37:41,144
The idea that you would stop buying things if they got cheaper is the single

689
00:37:41,144 --> 00:37:46,184
least credible claim ever made about a species that invented the shopping

690
00:37:46,184 --> 00:37:51,344
