1085
00:59:07,104 --> 00:59:09,604
On Wishonia, this is called a crime.

1086
00:59:10,044 --> 00:59:14,244
On Earth, it is called the Troubled Asset Relief Program.

1087
00:59:14,264 --> 00:59:16,764
Under Bretton Woods, this could not have happened.

1088
